				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirpudding" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(348648); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=348648&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606401915" alt="sirpudding" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=348648)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirpudding" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(348648); return false;" >sirpudding</a></span> <span class="odate time_1446398207 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">01 Nov 2015 17:16</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2400502">
									

<p>This was inspired by a failed coldpost some months ago that had the line &quot;If you read this, you are dead.&quot; I'd like to first thank the author of that article, but it was deleted before that line had bounced around in my head enough to make this.</p>
<p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mistbourne" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1665706); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1665706&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1520608618" alt="Mistbourne" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1665706)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mistbourne" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1665706); return false;">Mistbourne</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kol-aumer" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2218623); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2218623&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1520608618" alt="kol aumer" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2218623)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kol-aumer" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2218623); return false;">kol aumer</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-macleod" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1922529); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1922529&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1520608618" alt="Agent MacLeod" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1922529)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-macleod" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1922529); return false;">Agent MacLeod</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cavalry" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2210946); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2210946&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1520608618" alt="Cavalry " style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2210946)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cavalry" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2210946); return false;">Cavalry</a></span> , <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/psul" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2156983); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2156983&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1520608618" alt="psul" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2156983)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/psul" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2156983); return false;">psul</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/knightknight" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2032511); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2032511&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1520608618" alt="KnightKnight" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2032511)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/knightknight" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2032511); return false;">KnightKnight</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eta-carinae" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2110706); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2110706&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1520608618" alt="Eta Carinae" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2110706)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eta-carinae" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2110706); return false;">Eta Carinae</a></span> for feedback and critique.</p>
<p>The Antimemetics Division was created by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/qntm" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(571081); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=571081&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1520608618" alt="qntm" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=571081)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/qntm" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(571081); return false;">qntm</a></span> and the Counterconceptual Division by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/knightknight" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2032511); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2032511&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1520608618" alt="KnightKnight" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2032511)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/knightknight" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2032511); return false;">KnightKnight</a></span>.</p>
<p>The code that makes this work was borrowed from the code in <a href="/scp-2998">SCP-2998</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aelanna" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(334454); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=334454&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1520608618" alt="Aelanna" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=334454)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aelanna" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(334454); return false;">Aelanna</a></span>.</p>
<p>This took quite awhile before I figured out how to make all the parts fit.</p>
<p>There's commentary and a short FAQ over on <a href="/sirpudding-s-author-page">my author page</a>, that hopefully answers any questions you might have. If not feel free to ask here or in the discussion for that page!</p>
<p>The IWT Primer in the Foundation Universe section of my author page may also be helpful.</p>

